            "text": "Gracias por la retroalimentación. Entiendo los puntos de mejora y he corregido la consulta SQL para BigQuery, agrupando los resultados por `condition_concept_id` y `concept_name`, e incluyendo el nombre de la condición, la edad mínima y máxima al diagnóstico, además de la media, desviación estándar y percentiles.\n\nAquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT corregida y validada:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    co.condition_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name,\n    CAST(AVG(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) AS FLOAT64) AS mean_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(STDDEV(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) AS FLOAT64) AS stddev_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(MIN(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) AS FLOAT64) AS min_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(MAX(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) AS FLOAT64) AS max_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth, 100)[OFFSET(25)] AS FLOAT64) AS p25_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth, 100)[OFFSET(50)] AS FLOAT64) AS p50_age_at_diagnosis,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) - p.year_of_birth, 100)[OFFSET(75)] AS FLOAT64) AS p75_age_at_diagnosis\nFROM\n    `condition_occurrence` AS co\nJOIN\n    `person` AS p\nON\n    co.person_id = p.person_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\nON\n    co.condition_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    co.condition_concept_id IN (\n        192691, 193323, 194700, 195771, 200687, 201254, 201530, 201531, 201820, 201826, 318712, 373999, 377821, 435216, 439770, 443012, 443412, 443592, 4008576, 4009780, 4024659, 4030061, 4034960, 4034962, 4047906, 4048202, 4058243, 4062685, 4062686, 4062687, 4063042, 4063043, 4079850, 4096041, 4096042, 4096668, 4096670, 4096671, 4099214, 4099215, 4099217, 4099334, 4099651, 4099652, 4099653, 4099741, 4102018, 4129378, 4129516, 4129519, 4130162, 4130164, 4130166, 4136889, 4137214, 4140808, 4143529, 4143689, 4143857, 4144583, 4145827, 4151281, 4151282, 4152858, 4155634, 4166381, 4178452, 4178790, 4192852, 4193704, 4196141, 4198296, 4200873, 4200875, 4202383, 4212631, 4221344, 4222222, 4222410, 4222547, 4222553, 4222687, 4222834, 4223303, 4223444, 4224254, 4224709, 4224723, 4225013, 4225055, 4225656, 4226245, 4227210, 4228102, 4228112, 4230254, 4231917, 4235410, 4237068, 4240589, 4245270, 4252384, 4263902, 4295011, 4304377, 4312138, 4321756, 4322638, 4325113, 4326434, 4327944, 40480000, 40482883, 40488810\n    )\nGROUP BY\n    co.condition_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    co.condition_concept_id\n```"
          }
